    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supermarket Simulator Deluxe</strong> is an entertaining and challenging simulation game where you take on the role of a supermarket owner. <br>Your tasks include:<br> <br>1.)ordering and restocking goods. <br>2.)managing inventory. <br>3.)operating the cash register. <br>4.)expanding and designing your store.  <br><br>To run your supermarket successfully and grow it continuously, you'll need to focus on profitability, customer satisfaction, and efficient workflows at all times.</p>",
